# Optimal Idea

---

Instead of processing every query independently,

process the whole string once.

---

## Step 1

Store every zero block.

Example

```
001110000100011

Zero blocks

00
0000
000
```

Store

```
length
start
end
```

Example

```
length=[2,4,3]

start=[0,5,10]

end=[1,8,12]
```

