## Step 2

Every possible trade corresponds to

```
zero[i]
1-block
zero[i+1]
```

Its gain

```
gain[i]

=

zeroLength[i]
+
zeroLength[i+1]
```

Example

```
2 111 4

gain=6

4 11 3

gain=7
```

Store

```
gain=[6,7]
```

---

## Step 3

Build Segment Tree over gain.

```
gain

6 7 4 9 2

↓

segment tree

supports

maximum gain
```

Query

```
maximum gain between i..j

O(logn)
```

