# Why Binary Search?

Every query has different boundaries.

Need first zero block touching query.

Need last zero block touching query.

Use

```
bisect_left

bisect_right
```

on

```
zeroStarts
zeroEnds
```

Both

```
O(logn)
```

---

# Cases

Suppose query cuts zero blocks.

Example

```
000111000

query

  ^^^^^

011100
```

Left zero block is partial.

Need

```
partial length
```

Similarly right.

Middle blocks remain complete.

Hence three candidates.

---

## Candidate 1

Use left partial block

```
partialLeft
+
next full block
```

---

## Candidate 2

Use right partial block

```
previous full block
+
partialRight
```

---

## Candidate 3

Entirely internal blocks

Use segment tree.

---

Maximum of all three.

